# Realistic-looking fake credentials for tests/lib-secrets.bats.
#
# They live here rather than inline in the .bats file because check-secrets.sh
# scans this repo too, and tests/fixtures/* is the one prefix its skip list
# exempts -- precisely so intentional fake secrets have somewhere to live. An
# inline copy made the check flag its own test file and blocked every later
# commit in the repo. tests/pre-commit-blocking.bats hit the same wall first and
# solved it the same way.
#
# Sourced by the test, so these are shell assignments, not just documentation.
